                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf0a39ce-2738-34a9-adbd-f01261e46ca2",
                        "entry_id": "245ab50e-470b-33f1-ab83-dac72e7a4111",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Les femmes, au contraire, se rappelaient que vers la fin du monde, l’Antechrist doit venir séduire l’univers avec des bagues d’or, des boucles d’oreilles, des robes de soie et des éblouissements sans nombre : elles se défiaient, mais n’en étaient pas moins curieuses de voir ce qui se passait à Felsenbourg. — (Erckmann-Chatrian, Maître Daniel Rock, page 142, J. Hetzel, 1867)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e541100-ba11-4af6-a026-2814d00c28c5",
                        "source_entry_id": "245ab50e-470b-33f1-ab83-dac72e7a4111",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf0a39ce-2738-34a9-adbd-f01261e46ca2",
                        "target_lang_word": "Antichrist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Antichrist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c69a49d4-8dd5-3df6-ab2d-4b81fc13e08a",
                                        "entry_id": "bb5f3495-07d0-3c97-93b4-813af606273f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "der Widersacher von Christus"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fe21f2f-676d-48a3-979c-5c4e2ed3b829",
                                                "sense_id": "c69a49d4-8dd5-3df6-ab2d-4b81fc13e08a",
                                                "text": "Der Antichrist wird alle mit falscher Zunge verführen und die Menschheit ins Verderben führen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f52f183-fa93-448c-9de9-229daba3f12d",
                                                "sense_id": "c69a49d4-8dd5-3df6-ab2d-4b81fc13e08a",
                                                "text": "„In Bruchstücken ausphantasiert wird die Vorstellung eines unreinen, dem Antichristen ergebenen Volkes.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Antichrist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "864b7144-41a5-3de5-9d06-ad113b82d501",
                                        "entry_id": "ed1cce42-68fc-3434-8145-71bc3f1a3937",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die nicht Christ ist und Einwände gegen die christliche Glaubensgemeinschaft hat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d94729b9-0e5e-407c-8279-21f1e3e7569a",
                                                "sense_id": "864b7144-41a5-3de5-9d06-ad113b82d501",
                                                "text": "Die Antichristen lehnen nicht immer den Gottesglauben ab, aber verneinen die christliche Lehre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bb1a08e-803b-4d43-8c2d-8a26c222eb2a",
                                                "sense_id": "864b7144-41a5-3de5-9d06-ad113b82d501",
                                                "text": "„Hier wuchs der radikale Atheist und selbst ernannte ‚Antichrist‘, der wesentlich mit zu der fundamentalen Krise des Christentums am Übergang vom 19. zum 20. Jahrhundert beigetragen hatte, selbst zur Quelle religiöser Impulse heran.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57517147-8532-43ca-a7aa-bd25c2b22b48",
                                                "sense_id": "864b7144-41a5-3de5-9d06-ad113b82d501",
                                                "text": "„Und mit seinem Charisma und dem internationalen Hintergrund entspricht natürlich niemand dem Bild vom Antichrist so genau wie Präsident Barack Obama.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0544e45-2d41-4cb1-bd41-e7af554f65d7",
                                                "sense_id": "864b7144-41a5-3de5-9d06-ad113b82d501",
                                                "text": "„Letzteres wussten alle, nur Anton Millbacher konnte es nicht glauben, dass sein König mit dem Antichristen im Bunde stand.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dc9c789-3d14-489b-8be9-b71a4aa5b898",
                                                "sense_id": "864b7144-41a5-3de5-9d06-ad113b82d501",
                                                "text": "„Was sie vom Kriege, von Bonaparte und seinem Anmarsch hörten, das verknüpfte sich in ihren Hirnen mit ebenso verschwommenen Vorstellungen vom Antichrist, vom Ende der Welt und von einer unumschränkten Freiheit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18d6bd3d-cc95-47da-87d7-c36618079fa0",
                        "source_entry_id": "245ab50e-470b-33f1-ab83-dac72e7a4111",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf0a39ce-2738-34a9-adbd-f01261e46ca2",
                        "target_lang_word": "Antichrist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Antichrist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d21a9f3-a5da-3a6c-a726-0666120f345e",
                                        "entry_id": "02b6249b-3d6e-3ee8-a231-7c5c7e66c981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A false messiah who, under direct control of the Devil, will usher in the abomination in the end times; a false prophet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10c4014e-4e15-4611-b3a6-b1cee2d32f72",
                                                "sense_id": "9d21a9f3-a5da-3a6c-a726-0666120f345e",
                                                "text": "Little childꝛen, it is the laſt time: and as yee haue heard that Antichꝛiſt ſhall come, euen now are there many Antichꝛiſts, whereby wee know that it is the laſt time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "388c17dd-f3ba-4f68-a536-2b65b04134f7",
                                                "sense_id": "9d21a9f3-a5da-3a6c-a726-0666120f345e",
                                                "text": "[Ross Douthat:] Is Silicon Valley recklessly ambitious? What should we fear more: Armageddon or stagnation? Why is one of the world’s most successful investors worrying about the Antichrist? […] [Peter Thiel:] […] And the Christian framing, which in some ways is the same question, is: Antichrist or Armageddon? You have the one-world state of the Antichrist, or we’re sleepwalking toward Armageddon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2577aacc-024d-448d-973b-09a9b77cd743",
                        "source_entry_id": "245ab50e-470b-33f1-ab83-dac72e7a4111",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf0a39ce-2738-34a9-adbd-f01261e46ca2",
                        "target_lang_word": "antichrist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antichrist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23f29e1a-0a24-3538-a8e9-7198279850b5",
                                        "entry_id": "d15bf11d-c752-3b16-b1ea-ba9a3a5dc1d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who works against the teachings of Christ."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c39ee55a-62a3-4bba-b815-89869807c121",
                                                "sense_id": "23f29e1a-0a24-3538-a8e9-7198279850b5",
                                                "text": "Little childꝛen, it is the laſt time: and as yee haue heard that Antichꝛiſt ſhall come, euen now are there many Antichꝛiſts, whereby wee know that it is the laſt time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1ea41e7-c106-4a4c-a939-129e8a915872",
                                                "sense_id": "23f29e1a-0a24-3538-a8e9-7198279850b5",
                                                "text": "I am an antichrist / And I am an anarchist / Don't know what I want / But I know how to get it"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04b144b7-f5b4-44ba-ac00-2f0d697a7664",
                                                "sense_id": "23f29e1a-0a24-3538-a8e9-7198279850b5",
                                                "text": "At least as Auxentius reports him in the covering letter which precedes Ulfila’s confession, he is as vehement in his opposition to what he sees as heretical alternatives to his own form of belief as most other participants in the controversies of the time. Heretics are not Christians but antichrists. Homoousians, Homoiousians, and Macedonians are all included in this blanket condemnation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
